From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lethalbas <lethalbas@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 00:46:42 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] rt(entities,tse): port the RT entity hooks to EntitiesMP

Replays 1fd1cd9f (TFE Entities) onto SamTSE/Sources/EntitiesMP:
- PlayerWeapons.es: no RelativeToAbsoluteSmooth() for the first-person
  weapon (and its mirror) under GAT_RT; applied cleanly.
- Player.es: ctl_bFlashlight + shell symbol, per-tick flashlight state
  (srt_bFlashlightEnable) only while alive and not in a cutscene, and
  the RT-only BodyRemoveItem() guarded to GAT_RT. Hand-applied: the
  3-way merge produced two large conflict regions because TSE's shell
  declarations use (void *) casts and extra controls, not because the
  logic differs.
- Common/HUD.cpp: hud_bShowFlashlightHint and the RT flashlight hint.
  Hand-applied next to TSE's hud_bShowMatchInfo declaration.

Eyeman.es (RT: dead invisible Eyemen cast shadows) and the TFE
WeaponPositions/FOV tweaks are UX-only and not ported, as for TFE.

Ported code: Serious-Engine-RT (https://github.com/sultim-t/Serious-Engine-RT,
GPL-2.0-only) by Sultim Tsyrendashiev; original copyright notices kept.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 SamTSE/Sources/EntitiesMP/Common/HUD.cpp   | 18 +++++++++++++++++
 SamTSE/Sources/EntitiesMP/Player.es        | 23 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 SamTSE/Sources/EntitiesMP/PlayerWeapons.es | 10 ++++++++--
 3 files changed, 49 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/SamTSE/Sources/EntitiesMP/Common/HUD.cpp b/SamTSE/Sources/EntitiesMP/Common/HUD.cpp
index 10bc0c4373c6120badb4f68fde5437925ed88b83..081a61e8ad95f3fda542e790c2120e4c74c8e20a 100644
--- a/SamTSE/Sources/EntitiesMP/Common/HUD.cpp
+++ b/SamTSE/Sources/EntitiesMP/Common/HUD.cpp
@@ -63,6 +63,8 @@ extern FLOAT hud_fOpacity;
 extern FLOAT hud_fScaling;
 extern FLOAT hud_tmWeaponsOnScreen;
 extern INDEX hud_bShowMatchInfo;
+// RT: flashlight hint (from Serious-Engine-RT)
+extern INDEX hud_bShowFlashlightHint = 0;
 extern INDEX hud_bWeaponsIconScale; // HUD weapons icons scale: 0 - small, 1 - big
 
 // player statistics sorting keys
@@ -1390,6 +1392,19 @@ extern void DrawHUD( const CPlayer *penPlayerCurrent, CDrawPort *pdpCurrent, BOO
     _pDP->SetTextCharSpacing( -2.0f*fTextScale);
     _pDP->PutTextR( strLatency, _pixDPWidth, _pixDPHeight-pixFontHeight, C_WHITE|CT_OPAQUE);
   }
+
+  // RT: show
+  if (_pGfx->gl_eCurrentAPI == GfxAPIType::GAT_RT && hud_bShowFlashlightHint)
+  {
+    bool isColored = (INDEX)(_pTimer->GetLerpedCurrentTick() * 2.0f) % 2;
+    CTString strFlashlightHint = isColored ? "Press a ^c24D500Flashlight^r button to toggle it" : "Press a Flashlight button to toggle it";
+    _pfdDisplayFont->SetVariableWidth();
+    _pDP->SetFont(_pfdDisplayFont);
+    _pDP->SetTextScaling(_fResolutionScaling * hud_fScaling * 2.0f);
+    _pDP->SetTextCharSpacing(1);
+    _pDP->PutTextCXY(strFlashlightHint, _pixDPWidth * 0.5f, _pixDPHeight * 0.65f, C_WHITE | CT_OPAQUE);
+  }
+
   // restore font defaults
   _pfdDisplayFont->SetVariableWidth();
   _pDP->SetFont( &_fdNumbersFont);
@@ -1517,6 +1532,9 @@ extern void DrawHUD( const CPlayer *penPlayerCurrent, CDrawPort *pdpCurrent, BOO
 // initialize all that's needed for drawing the HUD
 extern void InitHUD(void)
 {
+  // RT: ugly way
+  _pShell->DeclareSymbol("INDEX hud_bShowFlashlightHint;", (void *) &hud_bShowFlashlightHint);
+
   // try to
   try {
     // initialize and load HUD numbers font
diff --git a/SamTSE/Sources/EntitiesMP/Player.es b/SamTSE/Sources/EntitiesMP/Player.es
